CC   IMGT/LIGM-DB annotation level: by annotators
CC   
CC   For an overview of the musigdjc loci see the first paragraph of
CC   'comment' in musigdjc01.
CC       The intergenic region presented in this locus & musigdjc13 can
CC   also be thought of as the c-delta 5' flank. It differs from other c
CC   gene 5' flanks because it does not possess the class-switch
CC   repetitive sequences. This and the fact that igd is usually
CC   coexpressed with igm show that igd is produced by alternative mRNA
CC   processing pathways rather than a class-switch recombination.
